# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for the in-app AI coach (Ask Atlas) and the automatic
# micro-step breakdown. Get one from Google AI Studio (aistudio.google.com) and
# create a file named `.env` in the project directory containing:
#
#   GEMINI_API_KEY=your_real_key_here
#
# The secrets Gradle plugin exposes it as BuildConfig.GEMINI_API_KEY at build time.
# AI Studio injects this automatically at runtime from user secrets.
#
# If the key is missing the app still builds and runs; the AI coach simply shows a
# clear "add GEMINI_API_KEY to .env" message instead of calling Gemini.
# IMPORTANT: Uncomment the line below if your app uses the Gemini API.
# If left commented out, the key will NOT be packaged in the APK.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=MY_GEMINI_API_KEY
